    "Other MATLAB research jobs were running on the host. Times are actual unprofiled single-thread controller-call wall measurements, not an isolated-machine speed comparison or a real-time guarantee.",
    "The prior safety-only campaign is reused from the immediately preceding recorded implementation, not rerun. Curved transverse-state diagnostics now correctly use the nominal curved reference; lateral-position comparison is unaffected.",
    "No fixture, model, margin, road-constraint, terminal invariant-set, time-budget or iteration-budget change. The benchmark uses default infinite slew limits; finite slew limits remain covered by behavior tests."
